I'm thinking about how to patch around the existing helper section by using the same IDs like `'table-style'`. I should add a new helper either before `_tableCellSelection` or after `_toolbarTableDocument`. It seems logical to insert it right after `_toolbarTableDocument()` and before `_tableCellSelection()`. That approach looks good to me, and I think it will keep things organized. Let’s move forward with that plan!
