I’m thinking that I might need to use `paddingFinder` within the same cell context. When I try `find.descendant(... matching: find.byType(Padding))`, it seems like it could potentially return multiple padding widgets. I wonder if one of those could be from `TextSelectionSurface` or if there might be others included too. I really want to ensure I’m accessing the right one without getting confused by too many options!
